  "factor_name": "Fast 3-day beta-neutral residual reversal with 40-day volatility scaling",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-EMA_3(r_i - beta_i,60 * median_cross_sectional_return) / rolling_std_40(r_i)",
    "description": "For each tradable asset, estimate a 60-day rolling beta to the cross-sectional median return, subtract the beta-explained market component, smooth the residual return with a 3-day EMA, and negate it for reversal. Scale by the asset's 40-day return volatility. All inputs are lagged through the decision date."
